# Locked media files (1.1.13)

Do not edit these when building tags, UI, settings, or other features.

- `CleanPlayer.tsx`: Android → `CleanPlayerMediaBridge` (default). Iframe only via env flag.
- `streamApi.ts` / `deviceResolve/**`: Media Bridge fetch and resolve — frozen.
- `youtubeEmbedUrl.ts`: opt-in iframe helper — do not change for Android routing.
- `MainActivity.java`: `setMediaPlaybackRequiresUserGesture(false)` + `keepWebViewMediaAlive`. No googlevideo interceptor, no embed-only cookie experiments.
